  "notable_quotes": [
    "Introducing isophthalate into 2D double-layered BUT-25 converted it into 3D BUT-27 containing three linkers: ATZ−, IPA2−, and HCOO−.",
    "Mixed-linker zeolitic MOFs are rarely obtained by one-pot synthesis because competing pathways tend to generate diverse products.",
    "BUT-27 achieves low detection limits of 0.19 μM for Fe3+ and 0.26 μM for Cr2O7 2−, below US-EPA minimum values."
